      "title": "Qt: Check Qt version before checking for errors",
      "message": "Qt: Check Qt version before checking for errors\n\nAdd conditional compilation to `ui/qt/rtp_player_dialog.cpp` to avoid\nbreakage in earlier Qt versions. Related to !23317.\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
