      "title": "Qt: Fix deprecation from Qt 6.11 (#20965)",
      "message": "Qt: Fix deprecation from Qt 6.11 (#20965)\n\nCheck `stream->outputState()` for `QAudio::IdleState` instead of\nchecking the error for `QAudio::UnderrunError` as it is deprecated in\nQt 6.11. Fixes #20965.\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
      "author_name": "Leonid Lednev",
      "author_email": "leonidledn@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-01-21T03:34:09.000-06:00",
